      "segmentId": "ch0000-s001",
      "text": "Олечка!",
      "translation": "奥廖奇卡！",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 2.96,
      "endTime": 5.06,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s002",
      "text": "Прекрасно выглядишь!",
      "translation": "你看起来真漂亮！",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 5.6,
      "endTime": 6.62,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s003",
      "text": "Как муж?",
      "translation": "丈夫怎么样？",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 7.02,
      "endTime": 7.6,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s004",
      "text": "Сынок?",
      "translation": "儿子呢？",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 7.8,
      "endTime": 8.12,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s005",
      "text": "Муж как всегда, а вот сын...",
      "translation": "丈夫还是老样子，不过儿子嘛……",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 8.84,
      "endTime": 10.68,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s006",
      "text": "На каникулах хотели отправить в Италию, а он ни в какую: хочу в Курск, к бабушке, к ребятам.",
      "translation": "假期我们想送他去意大利，可他死活不肯：我要去库尔斯克，去奶奶那儿，去找小伙伴们。",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 11.06,
      "endTime": 17.48,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s007",
      "text": "Там все свои, всё запросто, по-нашему...",
      "translation": "那里都是自己人，一切都很随意、很自在，就像我们自己家一样……",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 17.82,
      "endTime": 20.04,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s008",
      "text": "Представляешь?!",
      "translation": "你能想象吗？！",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 20.48,
      "endTime": 21.12,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s009",
      "text": "А что!",
      "translation": "那有什么！",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 21.6,
      "endTime": 22.12,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "ch0000-s010",
      "text": "Ну и правильно...",
      "translation": "那就对了……",
      "playlistIndex": 0,
      "startTime": 22.76,
      "endTime": 23.32,
      "timingStatus": "aligned",
      "sourceSentenceIndexes": []
    }
  ],
